      "value": "@{58c62e995865713647a7115b|full_name}: \nI assume this is not a new bug, but one that was not caught when the new station triggers were released. \n\nHere is a world with an easy repro: wrld_27f4a4d5-4945-4c37-996a-e6a7ae99ad3c\nThis world contains a single chair and a Canvas that displays the possible events. Have two people in the world, have one sit in the chair, and then leave the world. The second person will not see the event appear.",
